        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 282, Urban Door Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUrban in design this new chic door lever set from Omnia features a round rose combined with a very sleek lever. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting--installation screws are hidden--for a modern look. It fits standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door preparation. The shape of the lever is not only stylish, it is also comfortable to your hand--making it one of the best choices if you are looking to add contemporary elegance that are both beautiful and functional to your home. The Urban Door Leverset is available in passage, privacy, and dummy functions. The Urban Lever is available in 4 finishes. Omnia's 282 Lever will add a modern accent to any door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Urban Door Lever with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 282 Urban Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/lcn-4110.jpg?v=1704442264\" width=\"342\" height=\"138\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Urban Lever",
                "description": "Urban in design this new chic door lever set from Omnia features a round rose combined with a very sleek lever. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting--installation screws are hidden--for a modern look. It fits standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door preparation. The shape of the lever is not only stylish, it is also comfortable to your hand--making it one of the best choices if you are looking to add contemporary elegance that are both beautiful and functional to your home. The Urban Door Leverset is available in passage, privacy, and dummy functions. The Urban Lever is available in 4 finishes. Omnia's 282 Lever will add a modern accent to any door.\r\n",
